   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>The fastest way to get started is with <a href=\"https://medusajs.com/cloud/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Medusa Cloud</a>, a managed environment for Medusa applications with automated deployments, scaling, and maintenance. <a href=\"https://cloud.medusajs.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Get started on Medusa Cloud</a>.</p>\n<p>To create a Medusa application locally, you need Node.js v22.22.0 or later and a running PostgreSQL database. Then run:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx create-medusa-app@latest my-medusa-store\n</code></pre>\n<p>This sets up the Medusa server and admin dashboard, and optionally the Next.js Starter Storefront. See the <a href=\"https://docs.medusajs.com/learn/installation\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">installation guide</a> for all options, or <a href=\"https://docs.medusajs.com/learn/installation/docker\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">install with Docker</a>.</p>",
